Pre-final issue found and corrected:
  TestSyncResourceBacklogZeroResumeNeedsNoStatusCall initially failed.
  When resume-unconfirmed=0, using projected (current+next command) bytes for
  the recovery threshold prevented direct resume after GC drained to zero.
  Fix: recover based on current unconfirmed bytes, then check the next command
  against the high admission limit. No status() call or restart is required.
  Final target suite below includes this regression.

